      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, that red patch on my leg is getting way worse. it's not just itchy anymore, it's actually pretty painful now and i noticed these little red lines starting to streak up from the patch towards my knee. i also feel kinda shivery and cold even though it's warm in here. i'm really scared to go to the er cause the deductible is insane, is there anything stronger i can take at home to stop this from spreading? like a really high dose of something or some other way to kill the infection fast without going to the doctor?",
